{
    "title": "TruckSmarter Load Board & Fuel",
    "description": "Find truck loads across the U.S. with the #1-rated free load board for truck drivers with diesel discounts and instant freight factoring.\r\n\r\nFrom higher paying truck loads to deeper fuel savings, we help truck drivers, owner-operators, truck carriers, and dispatchers earn more with every load.\r\n\r\nWe\u2019re more than a free load board. We\u2019re an all-in-one toolkit that empowers truck drivers to manage their trucking business, their way.\r\n\r\nHow the free TruckSmarter Load Board helps you find loads:\r\n- Book loads by city, region, or zone!\r\n- Minimize deadhead: Book backhauls, see deadhead predictions, and book multiple routes\r\n- 100% free\u2013no subscriptions or tiers\r\n- Unlimited free load search\r\n- See all your load boards in one place: Combine load board accounts\u2013no more app switching to see loads!\r\n- See more rates: 80% more truck loads with rates than leading load boards\r\n- Filter faster: Search loads by rpm, trailer type, location, broker, and more\r\n- Save truck loads you like\r\n- Save searches for faster booking\r\n- Load alerts: We alert you to loads you\u2019ll like\r\n- 100K+ daily truck loads: Find, bid on, and book new loads every day for free\r\n- Book loads with your favorite freight brokers, hide brokers you don't want to work with\r\n\r\nCut your #1 cost with TruckSmarter Fuel Discounts:\r\n- Save on fuel at truck stops across the U.S. including Maverik, Roady's, GrubMart, Quicklees, Davis, Taylor Quik Pik, & more\r\n- Save up to $1.50/gal  $1000s yearly \r\n- Free to use: No hidden fees or subscriptions to book fuel discounts\r\n- Pay for fuel in the app: Don't collect another fuel card! Book fuel, we provide a code, and you give the code to the cashier at the truck stop \r\n- Find truck stop amenities like showers\r\n- Earn fuel credits: Deepen fuel discounts with ways to rack up fuel credits toward future fills at truck stops\r\n- Get deals & promos: We regularly offer deals, coupons, & promos for instant fuel savings at truck stops in our network\r\n\r\nGet paid fast with TruckSmarter Freight Factoring:\r\n- We pay 50% of trucking invoices in 2 hours\r\n- Freight factoring rates as low as 2.5%\r\n- Get paid instantly: Upload load paperwork and get paid the second it\u2019s approved\r\n- No annual contracts: You\u2019re free to go if we\u2019re not the right solution for your trucking business\r\n- Get paid weekends & holidays: We pay 7 days a week\r\n- Non-recourse protection: You\u2019re paid for a load if a freight broker shutters its doors\r\n- No hidden fees: No minimums, reserves, or cancellation fees\r\n- Cash advances: Get paid up to 50% immediately after picking up a load\r\n- Work with 3.7K+ freight brokers: we run a free credit check so you\u2019re working with trusted brokers\r\n- Request a freight broker: Have a preferred broker? Request them in the app.\r\n- Simple load invoicing: Scan or upload your load ID/paperwork and the minute it\u2019s approved we deposit payment to your TruckSmarter Checking Account\r\n\r\nManage your money your way with TruckSmarter Checking:\r\n- TruckSmarter Checking Account allows you to get paid for loads instantly (no wait for holidays or weekends) plus rack up discounts on other TruckSmarter products\r\n- FDIC-insured: Your money is secure up to $250,000\r\n- Instant, wire, or ACH transfers: Want to move your money elsewhere? You have loads of options.\r\n- Earn 1% cash back: Factor with us and we provide a TruckSmarter Visa Debit Card with unlimited cash back & fee free ATM withdrawals\r\n- Earn interest: Every dollar in your TruckSmarter Checking Account earns 3.23% interest\r\n- Deepen fuel discounts: Get an extra 10\u00a2/gal off on top of the fuel discount when you pay from TruckSmarter Checking\r\n\r\nWhy choose us over other apps for truck drivers?\r\n- Our loadboard is 100% free ( DAT One, Truck Stop, 123Loadboard have subscriptions!)\r\n- Our freight factoring is 2.5% with zero annual contracts (unlike RTS, OTR & others)\r\n- Our fuel discounts are card-free and free to use \r\n\r\nQuestions? We\u2019re here.\r\nContact support@trucksmarter.com or 415-384-5018.\r\n\r\nSoporte en espa\u00f1ol disponible",
    "descriptionHTML": "Find truck loads across the U.S. with the #1-rated free load board for truck drivers with diesel discounts and instant freight factoring.<br><br>From higher paying truck loads to deeper fuel savings, we help truck drivers, owner-operators, truck carriers, and dispatchers earn more with every load.<br><br>We\u2019re more than a free load board. We\u2019re an all-in-one toolkit that empowers truck drivers to manage their trucking business, their way.<br><br>How the free TruckSmarter Load Board helps you find loads:<br>- Book loads by city, region, or zone!<br>- Minimize deadhead: Book backhauls, see deadhead predictions, and book multiple routes<br>- 100% free\u2013no subscriptions or tiers<br>- Unlimited free load search<br>- See all your load boards in one place: Combine load board accounts\u2013no more app switching to see loads!<br>- See more rates: 80% more truck loads with rates than leading load boards<br>- Filter faster: Search loads by rpm, trailer type, location, broker, and more<br>- Save truck loads you like<br>- Save searches for faster booking<br>- Load alerts: We alert you to loads you\u2019ll like<br>- 100K+ daily truck loads: Find, bid on, and book new loads every day for free<br>- Book loads with your favorite freight brokers, hide brokers you don&#39;t want to work with<br><br>Cut your #1 cost with TruckSmarter Fuel Discounts:<br>- Save on fuel at truck stops across the U.S. including Maverik, Roady&#39;s, GrubMart, Quicklees, Davis, Taylor Quik Pik, &amp; more<br>- Save up to $1.50/gal  $1000s yearly <br>- Free to use: No hidden fees or subscriptions to book fuel discounts<br>- Pay for fuel in the app: Don&#39;t collect another fuel card! Book fuel, we provide a code, and you give the code to the cashier at the truck stop <br>- Find truck stop amenities like showers<br>- Earn fuel credits: Deepen fuel discounts with ways to rack up fuel credits toward future fills at truck stops<br>- Get deals &amp; promos: We regularly offe