 2.5% with zero annual contracts (unlike RTS, OTR &amp; others)<br>- Our fuel discounts are card-free and free to use <br><br>Questions? We\u2019re here.<br>Contact support@trucksmarter.com or 415-384-5018.<br><br>Soporte en espa\u00f1ol disponible",
